OL,4,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,5,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,6,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,7,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,8,     Gweek, Kate and Gillian explore
OL,9,     Gradical music for the festive
OL,10,     Gseason.
OL,11,G2200FCompline
OL,12,     GA reflective service of night
OL,13,     Gprayer from the Church of Our
OL,14,     GMost Holy Redeemer, Clerkenwell,
OL,15,     GLondon. With music by Distler,
OL,16,     GMaconchy and Soriano.
